}
The manifest idx_ac05aa13 contains references to the image configuration and layers. In this particular case,
the image has only one layer. Again, their digests correspond to the blob filenames listed
before.
The config file shows image metadata, environment variables, and command execution. At the
same time, it contains DiffID references to the layers used by the image and image creation
information:
